course: dictionary
lesson: 11496
title: Agility
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Agility means being able to move quickly, easily and lightly. «The cat's agility let it leap from the wall onto the fence without a sound.» Leap, fence and without a sound show that the cat moves fast and light.
explain: Agility can also describe the mind. «Mental agility» means thinking quickly and cleverly. «Her mental agility helped her solve the puzzle in seconds.» Quick, clever thinking solved it.
explain: Check your meaning by swapping it in. Does «moving quickly and lightly» still make sense in the cat sentence? Yes, so agility means moving quickly and lightly.
fact: Agility is a noun, so you can have agility or show agility.
fact: «Agility training» helps players change direction quickly and keep their balance.
fact: Cats, squirrels and monkeys are famous for their agility.
fact: Dog agility is a sport where dogs run through tunnels and over jumps.
fact: «Mental agility» means thinking quickly and cleverly.
exercise: «The goalkeeper's agility stopped the ball just before it crossed the line.» What does agility mean here? | *Moving quickly, easily and lightly | Sleeping very deeply | Shouting loudly at the crowd
exercise: Which animal is famous for its agility? | A heavy cow | A slow tortoise | A sleepy sloth | *A squirrel
exercise: «Her mental agility helped her solve the puzzle.» What does mental agility mean? | Feeling very tired after a long day | Carrying heavy bags up the stairs | Being loud in class | *Thinking quickly and cleverly
test: Dog agility is a fun sport where dogs jump and run. What is dog agility? | A race for cars | *A sport where dogs run through tunnels and over jumps | A sleeping contest for dogs | A dog show judged on fur
test: Which word is closest in meaning to agility? | *Nimbleness | Heaviness | Clumsiness | Weakness
exam: «The cat leapt across the roof with great agility.» What does agility mean here? | Being slow and heavy | Falling off the roof | *Moving quickly and lightly | Lying still in the sun
